<title>USA: Wesley Jessen VisionCare sets IPO terms.</title>
<headline>Wesley Jessen VisionCare sets IPO terms.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wesley Jessen VisionCare Inc said Friday it plans to offer 2.4 million common shares in an initial public offering.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the offering price to be between $19 and $21 a share, with proceeds being used primarily to reduce its debt load. The offer is expected to be completed by the end of the first quarter, Wesley Jessen said.</p>
<p>Information on the company's stock symbol was not available.</p>
<p>Wesley Jessen develops and manufactures soft contact lenses.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 308-8787))</p>
